- Nullable.inadmissible_filling_refused: no disjunct; successful null-tolerant behavior cannot bypass false admission; exact open admission computed.
- Nullable.daimon_empty_tests_still_open: no disjunct; empty interaction family still does not verify gaveUp. Exact gaveUp obligation computed.
- Nullable.unretained_repair_exists: no disjunct; conjunction computes exhausted retained unchecked search as open and a separately retained tolerant witness over the same domain/tests. Neither observation alone proves the claim.
- coin_interaction_obstruction: no disjunct; universal substitution argument maps both actual interaction successes to the landed no-foresight contradiction. It rules out every uniform filling, not just the two finite answers.

